<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALY WORLD CUP SQUAD.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALY WORLD CUP SQUAD.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's squad for World Cup qualifiers against Moldova and Georgia on October 5 and October 9 respectively was announced by coach Arrigo Sacchi on Sunday.</p>
<p>Squad: Luca Bucci, Francesco Toldo; Christian Panucci, Amedeo Carbone, Alessandro Costacurta, Ciro Ferrara, Paolo Maldini, Alessandro Nesta, Gianluca Pessotto; Dino Baggio, Antonio Conte, Angelo Di Livio, Diego Fuser, Roberto Di Matteo, Damiano Tommasi; Pierluigi Casiraghi, Enrico Chiesa, Fabrizio Ravanelli, Gianfranco Zola.</p>
</text>
